@startuml seq-payment

title Futbolix — Payment Processing, approved path (SEQ-04)

actor "Customer" as CUSTOMER
participant "Web App\n(React + Vite)" as WEB
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as GATEWAY
participant "payment-service\n:8084" as PAYMENT
database "payment schema" as PAYMENT_DB
participant "Wompi Sandbox" as WOMPI
queue "RabbitMQ\nfutbolix.events" as BUS
participant "reservation-service\n:8083" as RESERVATION
database "reservation schema" as RESERVATION_DB

note over CUSTOMER, RESERVATION_DB
  Precondition (MVP 1): the reservation exists as PENDING (SEQ-03) and
  payment-service consumed ReservationCreated, recording a PENDING payment (HU-PAY-002).
end note

== Start the checkout (HU-PAY-003) ==

CUSTOMER -> WEB : "Continuar al pago" on /booking/payment
WEB -> GATEWAY : start checkout\n{reservationCode} + Idempotency-Key
note right of GATEWAY
  Public endpoint, no JWT.
  Operation defined in the proposed
  payment-service.yaml (HU-ARC-002).
end note
GATEWAY -> PAYMENT : forward request
PAYMENT -> PAYMENT_DB : find the PENDING payment\nof the reservation
PAYMENT_DB --> PAYMENT : payment (amount, currency COP)
PAYMENT -> WOMPI : create transaction through the ACL\n(amount taken from the payment,\nnever from the client)
WOMPI --> PAYMENT : Wompi transaction identifier
PAYMENT -> PAYMENT_DB : store wompi_transaction_id\n(payment stays PENDING)
PAYMENT --> GATEWAY : 201 checkout data
GATEWAY --> WEB : 201 checkout data
WEB --> CUSTOMER : redirect to the Wompi checkout

== Customer pays at Wompi ==

CUSTOMER -> WOMPI : enters card data
note right of WOMPI
  Card data goes to Wompi directly.
  Futbolix never receives it.
end note

== Apply the result (HU-PAY-004) ==

WOMPI -> GATEWAY : webhook + X-Event-Checksum
note right of GATEWAY
  HTTPS only. Path pending (Q-002).
  Reachability from a local
  environment pending (Q-001).
end note
GATEWAY -> PAYMENT : forward webhook
PAYMENT -> PAYMENT : verify signature\n(invalid path: see SEQ-08)
PAYMENT -> PAYMENT_DB : PENDING → APPROVED\n(unique wompi_transaction_id:\na duplicate changes nothing)
PAYMENT -> BUS : publish PaymentApproved v1\n(routing key payment.approved)
PAYMENT --> GATEWAY : 200
GATEWAY --> WOMPI : 200

== Confirm the reservation (HU-RES-005) ==

BUS -> RESERVATION : deliver PaymentApproved\n(at-least-once)
RESERVATION -> RESERVATION_DB : in one transaction:\n1. insert eventId into processed_events\n2. Reservation.confirm(): PENDING → CONFIRMED
note right of RESERVATION
  A repeated eventId violates the
  processed_events primary key and the
  transaction rolls back: one transition.
  A reservation no longer PENDING is not
  changed; the outcome is ADR-005's.
end note

== Customer returns ==

WOMPI --> CUSTOMER : redirect back to Futbolix
CUSTOMER -> WEB : /booking/confirmation/:code
WEB -> GATEWAY : look up reservation by code (HU-RES-004)
GATEWAY -> RESERVATION : forward
RESERVATION --> GATEWAY : reservation status
GATEWAY --> WEB : reservation status
WEB --> CUSTOMER : reservation code shown large,\nwith a copy button

note over CUSTOMER, RESERVATION_DB
  The webhook and the customer's redirect are independent: either may arrive first.
  If the redirect wins, the lookup can still return PENDING (Q-012).
end note

@enduml
